        "text": "Liquor God Travel is the most special of those four, and it first appeared in The Legends of Ren Zu. Beside it, Dream Travel lets a Gu Master enter other people’s dreams, Carefree Travel is best at dodging attacks, and Fixed Immortal Travel teleports the user to a chosen place.",
